# Sloth Digest - Environment Variables Configuration
# Copy this file to .env.local (or .env) and populate the values below.

# ==============================================================================
# Open-Weight AI Model Provider Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# Sloth Digest runs on open-weight models through any OpenAI-compatible API.
#
# Option A: Groq (Recommended - ultra-fast inference, generous free tier)
# 1. Get a free API key at: https://console.groq.com/keys
# 2. Add your key below:
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Option B: Generic OpenAI-Compatible Open-Weight Provider
# Works with Together AI, OpenRouter, DeepInfra, vLLM, or any self-hosted server.
# AI_API_KEY=your_open_model_api_key_here
# AI_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# AI_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b

# Option C: Local Ollama (Completely offline & open-weight - keep your chats private!)
# 1. Install Ollama: https://ollama.com
# 2. Run: ollama run llama3.1
# 3. Uncomment the following lines:
# AI_PROVIDER=ollama
# AI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
# AI_MODEL=llama3.1:latest
